  "term": "Demerol",
  "definition": "Demerol is meperidine hydrochloride, a synthetic opioid drug. It acts at opioid receptors to produce morphine-like effects such as pain relief, sedation, euphoria, slowed breathing, pinpoint pupils, slowed heart rate, and physical dependence.",
